WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.335 --> 00:00:07.685
**PURPLE SATELLITES**

2
00:00:07.835 --> 00:00:09.185
Yeah...

3
00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:10.880
Purple satellites in the sky tonight...

4
00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:11.000
Looking down on me...

5
00:00:11.492 --> 00:00:24.668
I been searching for a sign...

6
00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:28.660
Purple satellites, floating through the night,

7
00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:31.880
Watching all my dreams while I&#x27;m chasing city lights,

8
00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:35.160
I been so far gone, trying to get my mind right,

9
00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:39.560
Purple satellites, guide me through the night.

10
00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:44.720
Purple satellites, tell me what you see,

11
00:00:44.720 --> 00:00:48.000
Do you see the kid that I was meant to be?

12
00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:51.220
Everybody changing, but I&#x27;m trying to stay me,

13
00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:57.240
Purple satellites, keep watching over me.

14
00:00:57.880 --> 00:01:01.000
Late nights, headlights, riding through the rain,

15
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:04.280
Thinking &#x27;bout the days when nobody knew my name,

16
00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:07.460
Had a lot of friends, now they&#x27;re strangers in the frame,

17
00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:10.760
Funny how success and pain kinda feel the same.

18
00:01:10.760 --> 00:01:14.160
Looking out the window, stars dancing on the glass,

19
00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:17.240
Trying not to think about how quickly time can pass,

20
00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:20.380
Everybody moving fast, living for the flash,

21
00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:23.680
I&#x27;m just trying to find a future that was built to last.

22
00:01:23.680 --> 00:01:26.900
Got a heart full of scars and a pocket full of hope,

23
00:01:26.900 --> 00:01:30.120
Had to learn to fly when I was hanging by a rope,

24
00:01:30.120 --> 00:01:33.360
Every single setback taught me how to cope,

25
00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:36.660
Now I&#x27;m looking at the sky whenever I feel broke.

26
00:01:36.660 --> 00:01:40.000
Purple satellites, floating through the night,

27
00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:43.160
Watching all my dreams while I&#x27;m chasing city lights,

28
00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:46.340
I been so far gone, trying to get my mind right,

29
00:01:46.340 --> 00:01:50.940
Purple satellites, guide me through the night.

30
00:01:50.940 --> 00:01:54.460
I remember sleeping with anxiety and fear,

31
00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:57.680
Now I&#x27;m in the spotlight but the darkness still appears,

32
00:01:57.680 --> 00:02:00.960
Money can&#x27;t erase all the memories and tears,

33
00:02:00.960 --> 00:02:04.100
That&#x27;s why I keep my family and my real ones near.

34
00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:07.100
Everybody wants the shine but they don&#x27;t know the cost,

35
00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:10.660
How many nights I sat alone feeling lost,

36
00:02:10.660 --> 00:02:13.040
How many bridges burned, how many lessons bought,

37
00:02:13.640 --> 00:02:16.700
How many battles fought before I reached the top.

38
00:02:16.700 --> 00:02:19.600
But I keep moving forward, never looking back,

39
00:02:19.600 --> 00:02:22.700
Every closed door became another different path,

40
00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:25.880
If tomorrow comes, I&#x27;ll be grateful where I&#x27;m at,

41
00:02:25.880 --> 00:02:29.220
If tomorrow doesn&#x27;t come, tell my people that I laughed.

42
00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:32.440
Purple satellites...

43
00:02:33.700 --> 00:02:35.500
Can you hear me calling?

44
00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:38.680
When the world gets cold...

45
00:02:39.800 --> 00:02:41.000
Will you stop me from falling?

46
00:02:41.480 --> 00:02:44.660
Now I&#x27;m on the rooftop watching dawn arrive,

47
00:02:44.660 --> 00:02:47.740
Thinking how a dream somehow became my life,

48
00:02:47.740 --> 00:02:51.040
Still got imperfections, still got things to fight,

49
00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:54.080
Still got faith that everything will be alright.

50
00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:57.400
If you feel alone, put your eyes into the sky,

51
00:02:57.400 --> 00:03:00.560
Every star&#x27;s a reminder that you&#x27;re meant to survive,

52
00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:03.840
Every storm eventually runs out of time,

53
00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:06.940
Every broken soul deserves another try.

54
00:03:06.940 --> 00:03:10.300
So I lift my head high, let the past fade away,

55
00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:13.400
Thankful for the nights that helped me see today,

56
00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:16.640
Purple satellites, watching while I pray,

57
00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:19.860
Guide me through tomorrow if I lose my way.

58
00:03:19.860 --> 00:03:23.120
Purple satellites, floating through the night,

59
00:03:23.120 --> 00:03:26.320
Watching all my dreams while I&#x27;m chasing city lights,

60
00:03:26.320 --> 00:03:29.560
Even when I&#x27;m gone, shining from the skyline,

61
00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:33.920
Purple satellites, everything&#x27;s alright...

62
00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:41.740
Everything&#x27;s alright...

63
00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:46.520
Purple satellites...
